OL,10,G0300 A Kestrel for a Knave by Barry
OL,11,G     Hines
OL,12,     F4 Extra Debut. In a raw, mean
OL,13,     Ftown, a boy turns to the one thing
OL,14,     Fhe can trust. A kestrel. Her name
OL,15,     Fis Kes. Stars David Brierley.
OL,16,G0400 The Billy Cotton Band Show
OL,17,     F4 Extra Debut. Music and comedy
OL,18,     Fstarring Mr Wakey-Wakey himself,
OL,19,     FBilly Cotton and his band. With
OL,20,     FFreddie and The Dreamers. From
OL,21,     F1963.
